OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for hanging flag
OL,4,Awith message for MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who hung a flag from York's
OL,7,Fmedieval walls which displayed an
OL,8,Fabusive message towards Labour MP
OL,9,FRachael Maskell has received a
OL,10,Fsuspended sentence.
OL,12,FLee Moran, 55, of York, put up a St
OL,13,FGeorge's Cross near Walmgate Bar with
OL,14,Fthe writing: "This one's for you,
OL,15,FMaskill" [sic] on 16 September last
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FMoran was sentenced at York Magistrates
OL,19,FCourt for one offence under the
OL,20,FCommunications Act and two public order
OL,21,Foffences after being convicted of all
OL,22,Fthree following a trial.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
