OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for hanging flag
OL,4,Awith message for MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaskell, who had previously called for
OL,7,Fother St George's Cross flags to be
OL,8,Fremoved from lampposts around the city,
OL,9,Fsaid the incident caused her to feel
OL,10,F"distressed with the threat of being a
OL,11,Ftarget in political violence".
